{
  "consts": ["i"],
  "title": { "zh": "量词的证明项" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "「∀x. …」的证明也是函数，只是参数不是证明，而是一样东西：给它 t，它还你关于 t 的那句话的证明。这叫<wiki-ref to=\"dep-function\"></wiki-ref>，<part-ref to=\"part:allE\"></part-ref>写作 p i。「∃x. …」的证明是一<b>对</b>：一样东西（见证）和它满足那句话的证明；用它时写 p.elim (fun a h => …)。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": { "zh": "→ 就是不依赖参数的 ∀。" },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "t-all_1",
      "kind": "proof",
      "terms": true,
      "step": { "zh": "∀ 是函数" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "∀x. P(x) → Q(x)", "q": "P(i)" }, "goal": "Q(i)", "term": "p i q" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Human", "Q": "Mortal" }, { "P": "Student", "Q": "School" }],
      "briefNote": { "zh": "证明项须为 p i q。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "p i：把安交给 p，得到的是关于安的那句话。" }],
      "solution": ["e = allE[t=i](p)", "m = mp(e, q)", "goal <- m"]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-all_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "terms": true,
      "step": { "zh": "任取框是 fun" },
      "tests": [{ "goal": "∀x. P(x) → P(x)", "term": "fun a h => h" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Human", "Q": "Mortal" }, { "P": "Student", "Q": "School" }],
      "briefNote": { "zh": "证明项须为 fun a h => h。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "fun a 是任取框（a 是任取的那一样），fun h 是假设框。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "g = allI[x=a](body: h) {",
        "  body {",
        "    h = impI[A=\"P(a)\"](body: h.body)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- g"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-all_3",
      "kind": "proof",
      "terms": true,
      "step": { "zh": "∃ 是一对" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "P(i)" }, "goal": "∃x. P(x)", "term": "⟨i, p⟩" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Human", "Q": "Mortal" }, { "P": "Student", "Q": "School" }],
      "briefNote": { "zh": "证明项须为 ⟨i, p⟩。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "一对的左边是例子，右边是例子满足它的证明。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["i = exI(p)", "goal <- i"]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-all_4",
      "kind": "proof",
      "terms": true,
      "step": { "zh": "实例框" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "∃x. P(x) ∧ Q(x)" }, "goal": "∃x. P(x)", "term": "p.elim (fun a h => ⟨a, h.1⟩)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Human", "Q": "Mortal" }, { "P": "Student", "Q": "School" }],
      "briefNote": {
        "zh": "证明项须为 p.elim (fun a h => ⟨a, h.1⟩)。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "fun a h 是实例框：a 是那样东西，h 是它满足的那句。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "f = exE[x=a](p, body: i) {",
        "  body {",
        "    s = andE(f.body)",
        "    i = exI(s.left)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- f"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
